      "verbatim": "Stage 0. Curve Finance is a protocol consisting of a _Decentralized Exchange (DEX)_ focused on stablecoin and correlated-asset swaps, _Isolated Lending Markets (Llamalend)_, and a _Stablecoin (crvUSD)_. Governance of the entire protocol is managed entirely through the _Curve DAO_, using a vote-escrowed token model (veCRV) where voting power is proportional to the amount of `CRV` locked and the remaining lock duration (up to four years).",
